# development | staging | production
# Release builds (vite build / PROD) reject missing env and reject `development`.
VITE_UAP_ENV=development

# Optional in development (defaults to same-origin via Vite /api proxy → localhost:8080).
# Required for staging and production — absolute HTTPS URL; localhost and embedded credentials forbidden.
# Authoritative name: VITE_UAP_API_BASE_URL (VITE_UAP_API_URL is ignored).
# VITE_UAP_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
#
# Mobile-browser local testing:
# - Leave VITE_UAP_API_BASE_URL unset (same-origin /api via Vite proxy).
# - Open http://<MAC_LAN_IP>:3000 on the phone — not http://127.0.0.1:3000 (phone loopback).
# - Do not point the phone at :8080 directly; use the Vite origin so cookies stay same-site.
# - Restart `pnpm dev` after vite proxy changes. LAN Origins used to 403 at Spring CORS until
#   the Vite proxy stripped Origin on proxied /api requests (dev-only).
